{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022212101049-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022212633\"/><p>宏福苑獨立委員會網頁已停止運作。</p><p>大埔宏福苑火災獨立委員會已完成研訊工作，並於今日(22日)向政府提交報告。《東網》記者瀏覽委員會網頁時發現該網站已停止運作，並彈出「獨立委員會已於2026年10月22日向行政長官提交報告，並已停止運作。」視窗，惟其中記錄本及相關文件仍在列，市民仍能瀏覽。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T13:42:02.513413+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:21:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T14:17:47.776963+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T13:37:54.542771+00:00","content_hash":"38f2ab6094865d6bab7358a3b1dda2536d9b0a62ef2174a0470a253a23187013","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}